  "name": "SecureMockMaker_createSpy",
  "arguments": {
    "settings": "mockSettings",
    "handler": "mockHandler",
    "object": "testObject"
  }
}
```

This call tells the testing framework to generate a spy around `testObject` while applying the custom behavior defined in `mockHandler` and configured through `mockSettings`.

